From 867df0034804814d66e303098bef2fc864f37dcf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:53:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add TCP proxy streams (proof of concept)

Client side of ESPHome's tcp_proxy component: TcpProxyOpenRequest/Response,
TcpProxyData, TcpProxyWindowUpdate and TcpProxyClose (message ids 156-160),
DeviceCapabilities.tcp_proxy_targets, and APIClient.tcp_proxy_open() returning
a flow-controlled TcpProxyStream.
